From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: arm64: dts: sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2: Enable the AHUB DAM card

The audio hub's DAM machine (ahub_dam_mach, the control-only sound card
"ahubdam") carries the hub's "Src Select" routing and DAM mixing
controls. The vendor BSP enables it in the board device tree; enable it
on the Orange Pi Zero2 as well. The card has no PCM device and registers
after the codec card, so the ALSA default card (card 0, the codec) does
not change; the HDMI card moves from index 1 to 2.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2.dts
index 0d30c072f..ff888cff5 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2.dts
@@ -13,6 +13,11 @@ / {
 	compatible = "xunlong,orangepi-zero2", "allwinner,sun50i-h616";
 };
 
+/* control-only sound card "ahubdam": audio hub routing and DAM mixing */
+&ahub_dam_mach {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &cpu0 {
 	cpu-supply = <&reg_dcdca>;
 };
-- 
Armbian

